Test Case: Legacy MA Aura vs NCMI EDP Dashboard – Application Accept Count Reconciliation

Business Requirement:

Validate the alignment of accepted application volumes between the legacy MA Aura dashboard and the new NCMI EDP dashboard.

Test Performed:

Comparison of application accept counts between the legacy MA Aura and NCMI EDP dashboards for an equivalent reporting period.

Expected Result:

Accepted application volumes should be broadly aligned, or any significant variances should be identified, documented and reviewed with the business.

Actual Result:

An approximate 10% variance has been reported between the legacy MA Aura and NCMI EDP dashboard accepted application volumes. Exact figures and screenshots are pending confirmation.

The legacy MA Aura dashboard includes additional processing through the Recruitment Mart SAS process, for which the full transformation logic has not yet been investigated.

A separate reconciliation against the Commercial Billing monthly sales file showed close alignment in total and accepted application volumes (refer to the Commercial Billing reconciliation test cases).

The dashboard variance remains an open item requiring business review and acceptance or further prioritised investigation.

Test Status: AMBER – Variance Identified / Pending Business Review

Evidence: Legacy MA Aura and NCMI EDP dashboard screenshots for the same reporting period (to be attached).